  - Key: ui.b999de1fe33b7771
    Source: ' to drive and reverse. '
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.ea0f5f5b5ef22a03
    Source: ' to steer. Brake before tight turns.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.20e9fa24638c52db
    Source: "Right stick \xB7 Look around. "
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.4f5cd02ef1007ba3
    Source: "Hold RMB \xB7 Look around. "
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.36596395a6d35ff2
    Source: ' resets the camera.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.023be34f67b39ad5
    Source: ' returns your vehicle to a safe point. Resets affect the recovery bonus.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.3da7e630673862b7
    Source: 'Bring your rear hitch close to the target''s tow point. '
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.0c60b473e0856985
    Source: ' attaches or detaches the cable.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.bb33dbdb2f216aee
    Source: 'Use '
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.2902dfa7be7e8095
    Source: ' to reel in and '
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.19eed0d787847730
    Source: ' to pay out. Ease off when the cable is at risk. Firm ground improves
      grip.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.132a7251bb9c3a59
    Source: Once the car is free, tow it to the marked drop-off and stop inside.
      If the cable detaches, return and reconnect.
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.f6dcbdc96574bcff
    Source: 'Stop near the workshop and detach your cable. '
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.c4da3c307f262380
    Source: ' opens the garage. Browsing previews a part; it does not buy it.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.1a1595bc68b86f3e
    Source: Bodies and engines add pull. Tires help apply it to the ground. Match
      cable strength to your pull and winch. Weight helps anchoring but adds load
      uphill.
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.1c79e850735d8542
    Source: Buy & Fit purchases the highlighted part. Owned parts refit for free.
      Saved setups store fitted equipment, and previews revert when you leave.
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:24
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.c58f39009deb3810
    Source: REPLAY TRAINING
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:31
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.e0a13d30c26141f8
