  - Key: ui.fa0c9a7b5740f7e0
    Source: YOU'RE READY TO ROLL
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:40
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.a73d87308bf79041
    Source: PRACTICE CAR DELIVERED
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:40
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.9c45f361ec642118
    Source: 'Training complete. Your career equipment is back in place.


      Choose
      a recovery when you''re ready. You can revisit the guide or training from the
      main menu.'
    Context: Assets/TowTrouble/Runtime/RecoveryHudTraining.cs:41
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.361dd9ce73b7afb3
    Source: 'Good work. One last stop: the workshop.


      We''ll park you in the
      yard. Open the garage, preview some equipment, then choose Finish Training.
      Practice purchases do not affect your career.'
