  - Key: ui.1e82be71a99a45f2
    Source: Workshop meadow
    Context: site:R01
    Aliases:
    - Poiana atelierului
  - Key: ui.0c53af0673999ad8
    Source: The front-left wheel is caught in a rut. Pull progressively toward the
      trail.
    Context: site:R01
    Aliases:
    - "Roata din fa\u021B\u0103-st\xE2nga este prins\u0103 \xEEntr-un \u0219an\u021B.
      Trage progresiv spre potec\u0103."
  - Key: ui.2e2b1cbac3b66fa3
    Source: Forest ruts
    Context: site:R02
    Aliases:
    - "\u0218leaurile din p\u0103dure"
  - Key: ui.192ee1ae98b0e2e1
    Source: The wheels dug two deep muddy ruts. Clear the tree first, then pull straight
      out of the tracks.
    Context: site:R02
    Aliases:
    - "Ro\u021Bile au s\u0103pat dou\u0103 \u0219leauri ad\xE2nci \xEEn noroi. Elibereaz\u0103
      mai \xEEnt\xE2i copacul, apoi trage drept din f\u0103ga\u0219e."
  - Key: ui.4f39b8ba06309561
    Source: Forest depot
    Context: "site:R02; site:R03; site:R06; site:R11; dropoff:B; scene:B \xB7 Depozitul
      forestier"
    Aliases:
    - Depozitul forestier
  - Key: ui.9ace0c08c992c2fc
    Source: The mud pit
    Context: site:R03
    Aliases:
    - Groapa cu noroi
  - Key: ui.001f0d993d10833a
    Source: The car is bellied on a mud ridge, with its wheels sunk in silt. Find
      firm footing for the winch.
    Context: site:R03
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina st\u0103 cu burta pe o creast\u0103 de noroi; ro\u021Bile sunt
      \xEEngropate \xEEn m\xE2l. Caut\u0103 sprijin ferm pentru troliu."
  - Key: ui.2a76611ec70f6e1c
    Source: Forester ravine
    Context: site:R04
    Aliases:
    - "R\xE2pa p\u0103durarului"
  - Key: ui.a2628e05e3f23dd9
    Source: The left wheels fell into the forest ditch. Move the tree and recover
      along the forward ramp.
    Context: site:R04
    Aliases:
    - "Ro\u021Bile din st\xE2nga au c\u0103zut \xEEn \u0219an\u021Bul p\u0103durarului.
      Mut\u0103 copacul \u0219i scoate ma\u0219ina pe rampa din fa\u021B\u0103."
  - Key: ui.ac3d9863750686fb
    Source: Lakeside landing
    Context: "site:R04; site:R05; site:R07; site:R19; dropoff:E; scene:E \xB7 Debarcaderul
      lacului"
    Aliases:
    - Debarcaderul lacului
  - Key: ui.984909636e11a4e2
    Source: Fishing shore
    Context: site:R05
    Aliases:
    - Malul de pescuit
  - Key: ui.f92e9c6e449eb81e
    Source: The car reversed into the lake; its wheels are underwater. Pull toward
      the dry bank ahead.
    Context: site:R05
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a intrat cu spatele \xEEn lac; ro\u021Bile sunt \xEEn ap\u0103.
      Trage spre malul uscat din fa\u021Ba ei."
  - Key: ui.e85d3f282ee120e8
    Source: Reed bank
    Context: site:R06
    Aliases:
    - "M\xE2lul de l\xE2ng\u0103 stuf"
  - Key: ui.483d1f63207c5886
    Source: Silt beside the reeds swallowed the rear wheels. Clear the tree and pull
      from firm ground.
    Context: site:R06
    Aliases:
    - "M\xE2lul de l\xE2ng\u0103 stuf a \xEEnghi\u021Bit ro\u021Bile din spate. Elibereaz\u0103
      copacul \u0219i trage dinspre terenul tare."
  - Key: ui.ae87f250d8710627
    Source: Shore boulders
    Context: site:R07
    Aliases:
    - Bolovanii de pe mal
  - Key: ui.1734c73dbb642639
    Source: The car slid onto the bank edge, with its left wheels lower. Pull up
      the ramp between the rocks.
    Context: site:R07
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a alunecat pe muchia malului; ro\u021Bile din st\xE2nga sunt mai
      jos. Trage spre rampa dintre bolovani."
  - Key: ui.b6df32d72abd80fd
    Source: Hidden bay
    Context: site:R08
    Aliases:
    - Golful izolat
  - Key: ui.d47f2f7ba8cd038d
    Source: The car is stranded in the cove with its lower body flooded. Winch it
      from the dry bank.
    Context: site:R08
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a r\u0103mas \xEEn apa golfului, cu partea de jos inundat\u0103.
      Folose\u0219te troliul de pe malul uscat."
  - Key: ui.b21c165200daf712
    Source: Gravel bend
    Context: site:R09
    Aliases:
    - "Curba cu pietri\u0219"
  - Key: ui.8c35de721a4c0fd7
    Source: Engine failure and sticking rear brakes. Free the wheels with a smooth
      pull, then tow the car to the workshop.
    Context: site:R09
    Aliases:
    - "Motor defect \u0219i fr\xE2ne spate gripate. Deblocheaz\u0103 ro\u021Bile
      prin tragere lin\u0103, apoi remorcheaz\u0103 ma\u0219ina la atelier."
  - Key: ui.e77aa65b0420d684
    Source: Mountain refuge
    Context: "site:R09; site:R10; site:R14; dropoff:C; scene:C \xB7 PREDARE"
    Aliases:
    - Refugiul montan
  - Key: ui.4f798501a2e0de7c
    Source: Below the mountain road
    Context: site:R10
    Aliases:
    - Alunecare sub drumul de munte
  - Key: ui.d21ed738231c7a0d
    Source: The car slipped below the road and sits tilted on the bank. Set up on
      the road above and pull it back uphill.
    Context: site:R10; site:R12; site:R23
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a alunecat sub marginea drumului \u0219i st\u0103 \xEEnclinat\u0103
      pe taluz. Pozi\u021Bioneaz\u0103-te sus pe drum \u0219i trage \xEEnapoi pe
      pant\u0103."
  - Key: ui.0deabe5de7757669
    Source: Below the road
    Context: site:R11
    Aliases:
    - "R\xE2pa de sub drum"
  - Key: ui.74cf36d23db5a763
    Source: One side slid below the road. Recover along the dirt ramp without pulling
      sideways.
    Context: site:R11
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a alunecat cu o latur\u0103 sub nivelul drumului. Scoate-o pe
      rampa de p\u0103m\xE2nt, f\u0103r\u0103 tragere lateral\u0103."
  - Key: ui.163deee5b38e32a0
    Source: Slipped off the switchback
    Context: site:R12
    Aliases:
    - "Ie\u0219ire de pe serpentin\u0103"
