  - Key: ui.93efd2c5a08ba557
    Source: High cabin
    Context: "site:R13; site:R15; dropoff:D; scene:D \xB7 PREDARE"
    Aliases:
    - Cabana de altitudine
  - Key: ui.b1593f16d98e4de8
    Source: Frozen hairpin
    Context: site:R14
    Aliases:
    - "Serpentina \xEEnghe\u021Bat\u0103"
  - Key: ui.6bb4b8dd087b6ed4
    Source: The wheels slid into an icy ditch. Clear the fallen tree and keep the
      cable aligned with the ditch.
    Context: site:R14
    Aliases:
    - "Ro\u021Bile au c\u0103zut \xEEntr-un \u0219an\u021B \xEEnghe\u021Bat. \xCEndep\u0103rteaz\u0103
      copacul \u0219i \u021Bine cablul aliniat cu \u0219an\u021Bul."
  - Key: ui.31f91ba56cae60e5
    Source: Blizzard ditch
    Context: site:R15
    Aliases:
    - "\u0218an\u021Bul din viscol"
  - Key: ui.aa539a26f920e2cd
    Source: The blizzard packed snow under the chassis and around the wheels. Pull
      steadily along the packed tracks.
    Context: site:R15
    Aliases:
    - "Viscolul a str\xE2ns z\u0103pad\u0103 sub \u0219asiu \u0219i \xEEn jurul ro\u021Bilor.
      Trage progresiv pe culoarul tasat."
  - Key: ui.c85150bd1c8a1ea2
    Source: Summit plateau
    Context: site:R16
    Aliases:
    - "Platoul de sub v\xE2rf"
  - Key: ui.62af44cf3d3a5491
    Source: Engine failure and a seized transmission; the wheels dragged snow up
      to the chassis. Pull straight from firm ground to unjam it.
    Context: site:R16
    Aliases:
    - "Motor defect \u0219i transmisie \xEEn\u021Bepenit\u0103; ro\u021Bile au t\xE2r\xE2t
      z\u0103pada p\xE2n\u0103 la \u0219asiu. Trage drept pentru deblocare, de pe
      sprijin ferm."
  - Key: ui.bdcb2fefae3a4276
    Source: Sandy entrance
    Context: site:R17
    Aliases:
    - "Intrarea \xEEn nisip"
  - Key: ui.78cb4dbd5c233ce1
    Source: The rear wheels dug two pits in the sand. Pull from compact ground without
      jerking the cable.
    Context: site:R17
    Aliases:
    - "Ro\u021Bile din spate au s\u0103pat dou\u0103 gropi \xEEn nisip. Trage dinspre
      terenul compact, f\u0103r\u0103 smucituri."
  - Key: ui.8622c5d52ff99b4f
    Source: Beach parking
    Context: "site:R17; site:R18; site:R24; dropoff:F; scene:F \xB7 Parcarea de pe
      plaj\u0103"
    Aliases:
    - "Parcarea de pe plaj\u0103"
  - Key: ui.9230e8aec26a03f0
    Source: Low bluff
    Context: site:R18
    Aliases:
    - "Faleza joas\u0103"
  - Key: ui.241f67312b1ec9eb
    Source: One side fell into the beach ditch. Clear the fallen trunk and use the
      forward ramp.
    Context: site:R18
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a c\u0103zut cu o latur\u0103 \xEEn \u0219an\u021Bul falezei.
      Elibereaz\u0103 trunchiul \u0219i folose\u0219te rampa din fa\u021B\u0103."
  - Key: ui.7fd2a014d30536cc
    Source: Wet sand
    Context: site:R19
    Aliases:
    - Nisipul umed
  - Key: ui.eb5b1ab5ca21e20b
    Source: Wet sand piled beneath the axle; the wheels left glossy ruts. Position
      on firmer sand.
    Context: site:R19
    Aliases:
    - "Nisipul umed s-a adunat sub punte; ro\u021Bile au l\u0103sat f\u0103ga\u0219e
      lucioase. Pozi\u021Bioneaz\u0103-te pe nisip tare."
  - Key: ui.5b698c87cea1c112
    Source: Lakeside dune
    Context: site:R20
    Aliases:
    - Duna de pe mal
  - Key: ui.10486207171b93b8
    Source: The car is bellied on the dune crest. Pull down the broad forward ramp.
    Context: site:R20
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina st\u0103 cu burta pe creasta dunei. Scoate-o pe rampa lat\u0103
      din fa\u021B\u0103."
  - Key: ui.96996cb476f18c55
    Source: Dry wash
    Context: site:R21
    Aliases:
    - Vadul uscat
  - Key: ui.af4a773adc4bc552
    Source: The car slid into a dry wash; its banks rise above the wheels. Use the
      forward escape ramp.
    Context: site:R21
    Aliases:
    - "Ma\u0219ina a alunecat \xEEn albia uscat\u0103; marginile vadului sunt deasupra
      ro\u021Bilor. Ie\u0219i pe rampa din fa\u021B\u0103."
  - Key: ui.97d563a7a4c39720
    Source: Desert stop
    Context: "site:R21; site:R23; dropoff:G; scene:G \xB7 Popasul de\u0219ertului"
    Aliases:
    - "Popasul de\u0219ertului"
  - Key: ui.72afc76c751e6e54
    Source: Deep dunes
    Context: site:R22
    Aliases:
    - "Dunele ad\xE2nci"
  - Key: ui.cd5e6df0ef0592b4
    Source: The rear axle is buried in sand. Wheelspin marks and piled sand reveal
      the blockage.
    Context: site:R22
    Aliases:
    - "Puntea din spate este \xEEngropat\u0103 \xEEn nisip. Urmele de patinare \u0219i
      nisipul ridicat arat\u0103 blocajul."
  - Key: ui.6ad57164e9a09e97
    Source: Canyon roadside bank
    Context: site:R23
    Aliases:
    - Taluzul canionului
  - Key: ui.38e1915168474206
    Source: Sand slope
    Context: site:R24
    Aliases:
    - Versantul de nisip
  - Key: ui.eb117c541278b346
    Source: Engine failure and jammed brakes; the wheels ploughed into the sand.
      Unjam the car with a controlled pull, then tow it to the workshop.
    Context: site:R24
    Aliases:
    - "Motor defect \u0219i fr\xE2ne blocate; ro\u021Bile au s\u0103pat nisipul.
      Deblocheaz\u0103 ma\u0219ina prin tragere controlat\u0103, apoi remorcheaz-o
      la atelier."
  - Key: ui.9d6bf8b9851bbea4
    Source: ALPINE POST
    Context: "scene:D \xB7 POSTUL ALPIN"
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.7f82bf23964ff71b
    Source: DROP-OFF
    Context: "scene:PREDARE B; scene:PREDARE \xB7 D; scene:PREDARE H; scene:PREDARE
