  - Key: ui.dc733576b5c2e6db
    Source: Clear the fallen tree before recovering the car.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.7abc1b9668b17c92
    Source: Use firm ground and the winch to free the vehicle.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.0d4c5dc846de5ea8
    Source: Tow the freed car to the marked drop-off and stop inside.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.2b85d8b9aaa19973
    Source: Preview parts before buying. Owned parts can be fitted for free.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.8d22a4e276d89094
    Source: Choose one starter for free. Buy other vehicles later in the workshop.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.5f5596d6ecd3c742
    Source: Audio and control preferences save automatically.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.498d6153a8654337
    Source: Adjust the volumes separately. Visual warnings remain visible.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.0b2b7985cde3b328
    Source: Choose a control to rebind it. Each key can have only one action.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.6551bef2f757857c
    Source: Connect a controller to see its controls. Keyboard and mouse remain available.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.97e05cafa2817874
    Source: Reduce camera and menu motion for comfort.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.804902984ffa48c2
    Source: Show symbols as well as colours for cable tension.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.1ab992befc3510de
    Source: Text size and camera sensitivity can be changed at any time.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.66b058412dcd097f
    Source: Restore the defaults for this tab? Career progress is kept.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.b7656590697a2894
    Source: Reset all progress? Credits, vehicles, equipment and saved setups will
      be erased. Preferences will be kept.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.f46b776c482dd8ec
    Source: Leave the session before resetting progress.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.0af33ce5935c5bc1
    Source: Keep the display settings? They revert after 15 seconds unless confirmed.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.279d432b8494510f
    Source: These parts do not fit the new body. They stay in your inventory.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.a5dc8363185f7ce6
    Source: Sell this part? You must buy it again to use it.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.5781b54cf2720d6b
    Source: Save the fitted equipment. Parts being previewed are not saved.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.ebedeaaa78cc99aa
    Source: Replace this saved setup with the fitted equipment?
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.7c5bbd344ceba64a
    Source: Practice driving, connecting a cable, winching and delivery. Your career
      stays safe.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.06e7244dde4ed560
    Source: Training can be skipped and replayed from How to Play.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.c04a77ffb2b1c99e
    Source: The host chooses the recovery for the crew.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.7a31a8c0c6f7b091
    Source: Share the host's local IP address to play together.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.ba5cdeb94332e5e1
    Source: Starting your game. Please wait.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.abb73e21c3b1c8ed
    Source: The game could not start. Return to the menu and try again.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.b94997004ebce898
    Source: Leave this recovery without payment? Purchased equipment and earned credits
      are kept.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.cf15104b205f4987
    Source: Use suitable tires, enough pulling power and a strong cable.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.144cdfb47628c3c6
    Source: More weight helps anchoring but makes uphill towing harder.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.daf653a6178d7d91
    Source: Open the garage while stopped near the workshop.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.e228610b31a0e8f7
    Source: You can change these settings later.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
