    Source: Your career equipment is restored. Choose a recovery when ready.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
  - Key: ui.c2f20166c8709333
    Source: Winch gently and keep the cable aligned with the exit.
    Context: authored localization concept
    Aliases: []
